+
+## 13. Open questions
+
+1. **Language of articles.** The plan indexes English-stemmed *and* exact words (§6). If most articles
+   will be in Malay, switch the stemmed part to `simple` only — Postgres has no Malay stemmer.
+2. **Engineer publishing.** Proposed: engineers publish Internal freely; Public needs an Admin / KB
+   manager. Alternative: engineers publish everything (faster, less control).
